{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "8a32d1f4-3d12-4f7b-9c60-c4e9f78d91a2",
        "name": "Waai Media - Categories API",
        "description": "Comprehensive Postman Collection for the Waai Media Static Categories API (Laravel 13 backend).\n\n### Overview:\nThe Categories module provides a centralized, read-only category taxonomy for News, Blogs, and Portfolio.\n- **News**: 9 top-level categories, including Entertainment with 4 subcategories (hierarchical).\n- **Blogs**: 5 categories (flat array, exact 'Case Studied' preserved).\n- **Portfolio**: 6 categories (flat array).\n- Total: exactly 24 records.\n\n### Endpoint:\n`GET /api/v1/categories?type={news|blogs|portfolio}`\n\n### Features:\n- Public unauthenticated access (no Bearer token required).\n- Required `type` parameter (422 on missing/invalid).\n- Multilingual negotiation via `Accept-Language` (Arabic & English), with regional and quality weight support.\n\n### Variables:\n- `base_url`: Target host (default: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`).",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "base_url",
            "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
            "type": "string"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "1. News Categories",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "1.1 News - English (Default)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                                    "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "pm.test('Returns 9 top-level News categories in English', function () {",
                                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.be.an('array');",
                                    "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.length).to.eql(9);",
                                    "    pm.expect(jsonData.data[0].name).to.eql('Health');",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "pm.test('Entertainment category has exactly 4 children', function () {",
                                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    var entertainment = jsonData.data.find(function(c) { return c.slug === 'entertainment'; });",
                                    "    pm.expect(entertainment).to.not.be.undefined;",
                                    "    pm.expect(entertainment.children).to.be.an('array');",
                                    "    pm.expect(entertainment.children.length).to.eql(4);",
                                    "    pm.expect(entertainment.children[0].slug).to.eql('celebrities');",
                                    "});"
                                ],
                                "type": "text/javascript"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/categories?type=news",
                            "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "categories"],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "type",
                                    "value": "news"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Retrieves 9 top-level News categories in English by default. Entertainment includes exactly 4 children; other categories return empty children arrays."
